eart of IV.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2018-05-25 20:26:57\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I was feeling like I wanted Fettucini Alfredo with chicken, yet didn't want to sit down and pay $22.  There's a location downtown that's cheap and fast I work in Goleta so I decided to google \\\\\\\"Italian food, Goleta\\\\\\\" and Sorriso Italiano popped up.  A co worker and I decided to give it a go, and we were more than pleasantly surprised.  The alfredo sauce was impressive for such a quick call in order.  Highly recommend it!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Sorriso Italiano is an Italian restaurant located at 901 Embarcadero Del Mar in Isla Vista, CA. It offers outdoor seating and WiFi, as well as takeout and reservation options. The restaurant has a rating of 4 stars out of 5 on Google, based on reviews from customers who appreciate its affordable prices, delicious food, and excellent customer service. The restaurant also offers a variety of dishes that cater to different dietary needs, including vegetarian options. Overall, Sorriso Italiano appears to be a popular choice for those looking for authentic Italian cuisine in Isla Vista.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "grammar": "root ::= \"{\" ws \"\\\"unsupported_probability\\\"\" ws \":\" ws probability ws \",\" ws \"\\\"source_sentence_id\\\"\" ws \":\" ws citation ws \"}\"\nprobability ::= \"0\" (\".\" [0-9]+)? | \"1\" (\".\" \"0\"+)?\ncitation ::= \"null\" | \"0\" | [1-9] [0-9]*\nws ::= [ \\t\\n\\r]*", "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 69058, "max_tokens": 96, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
