ays of gorging on high fat and high calorie foods, on your first 2 days of injections. single round of hCG is either 26 or 43 days long, depending on how much weight you want to lose. Each round will start with 2 days of gorging on high fat and high calorie foods, on your first 2 days of injections.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"how long between hcg rounds\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"If you are doing a 3rd round of the HCG Diet, you must wait 8 weeks from the time your 2nd round ends before you can begin your 3rd round of injections. The amount of time between rounds should get progressively longer if you want to do a 4th or 5th round.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "grammar": "root ::= \"{\" ws \"\\\"unsupported_probability\\\"\" ws \":\" ws probability ws \",\" ws \"\\\"source_sentence_id\\\"\" ws \":\" ws citation ws \"}\"\nprobability ::= \"0\" (\".\" [0-9]+)? | \"1\" (\".\" \"0\"+)?\ncitation ::= \"null\" | \"0\" | [1-9] [0-9]*\nws ::= [ \\t\\n\\r]*", "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 69058, "max_tokens": 96, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
