erience with the staff.\\n\\nOverall, Stone Age Restaurant appears to be a decent option for those looking for traditional Chinese cuisine in the Santa Barbara area. While there have been some issues with the quality of certain dishes and service, the restaurant generally receives positive reviews for its authentic food and convenient location.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
