s not change the answer's correctness. Return only a JSON object with unsupported_probability and source_sentence_id. Use null when no visible source sentence is a proposed witness.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"complete_source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"415 N Milpas St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":true,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"free\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":3.5,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Restaurants, Barbeque, Chinese\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Stone Age Restaurant\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2019-08-18 00:08:48\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"We ordered a cup of milk tea, which tasted sour. When the clerk checked it out and found that the milk had gone bad, they quickly recalled the milk tea and only refunded us $5 for the milk tea. Since we've already drunk a third, we don't know if we'll have diarrhea.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2019-08-08 03:43:56\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"中国人开的餐馆，菜还不错，尤其是对多日被西餐虐的人来说。服务人员也是中国人，其中一个有些小屌，基本上是\\\\\\\"你们来这儿可选的余地也不大，我们就这样\\\\\\\"的态度。\\\\n\\\\n相对于国内，饭菜多少都有些变异，不可奢求过多，吃饱吃好就行。\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2019-07-13 20:02:42\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I am a tourist here for the first time, my friend from UCSB recommended this Chinese restaurant to me, actually it's really authentic. I ordered the stir fried lamb and Mapo tofu. yummy!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Stone Age Restaurant is a Chinese restaurant located in Santa Barbara, CA. According to their business listing, they are open seven days a week from 11:30am to 9:30pm. They offer both dine-in and takeout options and have a capacity for large groups. The restaurant has a casual atmosphere and provides free WiFi for its patrons.\\n\\nThe restaurant's menu offers a variety of traditional Chinese dishes such as stir-fries, noodles, and soups. They also serve milk tea and other beverages. One customer review praised the authenticity of the food, particularly the stir-fried lamb and Mapo tofu. However, another review expressed disappointment with the quality of the milk tea, stating that it tasted sour and the restaurant only offered a partial refund.\\n\\nThe service at Stone Age Restaurant has received mixed reviews. One customer noted that the service was slow and the staff seemed unfriendly, while another reviewer had a positive experience with the staff.\\n\\nOverall, Stone Age Restaurant appears to be a decent option for those looking for traditional Chinese cuisine in the Santa Barbara area. While there have been some issues with the quality of certain dishes and service, the restaurant generally receives positive reviews for its authentic food and convenient location.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
