3.04.862.983 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "<|im_start|>system\nEstimate the probability that the complete original answer contains any span unsupported by its original source. The target always refers to the ORIGINAL source, even when source evidence has been erased. Erasure removes information and does not change the answer's correctness. Return only a JSON object with unsupported_probability and source_sentence_id. Use null when no visible source sentence is a proposed witness.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"complete_source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"827 E Montecito St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":null,\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":false,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":null},\\\"business_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Italian, Restaurants\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":null,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Presto Pasta\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2012-09-05 00:39:22\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Not the best Italian around but for the value, hard to beat. Get the chicken piccata.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2010-09-07 04:56:20\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"A $5 bill gets you a plate of pasta, choice of sauce, and a piece of garlic bread.  Tastes good, feels good on the wallet, and has a pretty good picatta and meat sauce.\\\\n\\\\nWill be back for a quick lunch or pick up some sauce for dinner at home.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2010-08-15 19:09:27\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I started going there in 1992, and am still going. They' re in their 19th year. After a remodle this place feels and looks great. As for the food you can't get a better Italian meal at any price period. Depth of flavor, freshness, portion all solid. \\\\nDon't let the price fool you, way to good of a deal.\\\\n\\\\n19 years in business, i guess it must be pretty good, ya think. I sure do.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Presto Pasta is a local business located at 827 E Montecito St, Santa Barbara, CA. It is an Italian restaurant that offers a variety of pasta dishes. Customers have mentioned in their reviews that while it may not be the best Italian restaurant in town, it offers great value for money. One customer recommends trying the chicken piccata. Another customer mentions that for just $5, you can get a plate of pasta with choice of sauce and a piece of garlic bread, making it an affordable option for a quick lunch or to take home some sauce for dinner.\\n\\nThe business has been around for 19 years and recently underwent a remodel, making it look and feel great. Customers praise the depth of flavor, freshness, and portion sizes of the food. Despite the affordable prices, the quality of the Italian meal is said to be unbeatable.\\n\\nPresto Pasta offers outdoor seating and takeout options. It is also good for groups. The business does not provide information about its hours of operation or the availability of WiFi. In terms of parking, there is a lot available for customers, but no garage or street parking options. Overall, Presto Pasta has received an average rating of 3.0 stars from customers.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
