raint (greater than or equal to, less than or equal to, or equal to) from the drop-down menu.\\n\\nFinally, set the objective function that you want to maximize or minimize by clicking on \\\"Set Objective\\\" in the Solver window. Specify the objective cell reference and select whether you want to maximize or minimize the objective.\\n\\nAfter setting up the problem, click on \\\"Solve\\\" in the Solver window to find the optimal solution. Excel Solver will use mathematical algorithms to determine the optimal values for the variables that satisfy the constraints and optimize the objective function.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
