ate\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Hot Spots Espresso Company was a popular spot for locals and tourists alike, located at 36 State Street in Santa Barbara, California. The business offered food, restaurants, coffee & tea and had outdoor seating. The company had parking available on the street, but it was not validated. Free Wi-Fi was available for customers to use while sipping their coffee. Unfortunately, the business has closed down and is no longer operational. Customers have left reviews expressing their disappointment over the closure and sharing their experiences at the establishment. One reviewer praised the coffee and friendly service, while another noted that it was their favorite coffee place in the area. However, a third customer had a negative experience and complained about a rude attitude from the staff who were not aware of a Groupon deal. Despite the closure, the memories of Hot Spots Espresso Company will live on through the reviews left by its loyal customers.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
