a popular and well-liked spot in Santa Barbara, offering a wide range of drinks and food options in a casual and trendy setting. The friendly staff and excellent customer service are definite perks, and the bar's central location makes it easy to drop by for a quick visit or a longer evening out.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
