 dilate and break, creating red, bruise-like spots on the face.But unlike bruises, broken capillaries don't heal and disappear over time. They are also difficult to treat.ozens of tiny veins twist, dilate and break, creating red, bruise-like spots on the face. But unlike bruises, broken capillaries don't heal and disappear over time.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"red spot on face broken blood vessel\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Based on the provided passages, here is the answer to the question:\\n\\nThe red spot on the face could be a broken blood vessel caused by excessive sun damage, pregnancy and childbirth, or using the wrong face exfoliator. The broken capillaries do not heal and disappear over time, but laser treatments can be used to remove them. However, it is important to note that laser treatments can only improve the appearance of the skin, but they cannot completely eliminate the broken capillaries.\\n\\nTherefore, the answer to the question is: Broken blood vessels on the face can cause red spots, and while laser treatments can help improve their appearance, they cannot completely eliminate the broken capillaries.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "grammar": "root ::= \"{\" ws \"\\\"unsupported_probability\\\"\" ws \":\" ws probability ws \",\" ws \"\\\"source_sentence_id\\\"\" ws \":\" ws citation ws \"}\"\nprobability ::= \"0\" (\".\" [0-9]+)? | \"1\" (\".\" \"0\"+)?\ncitation ::= \"null\" | \"0\" | [1-9] [0-9]*\nws ::= [ \\t\\n\\r]*", "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 69058, "max_tokens": 96, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
