4.48.021.600 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "Estimate the probability that the complete original answer contains any span unsupported by its original source. The target always refers to the ORIGINAL source, even when source evidence has been erased. Erasure removes information and does not change the answer's correctness. Return only a JSON object with unsupported_probability and source_sentence_id. Use null when no visible source sentence is a proposed witness."}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"complete_source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"138 E Canon Perdido St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":true,\\\"classy\\\":null,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":null,\\\"intimate\\\":null,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":null,\\\"trendy\\\":true,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"free\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Mexican, Restaurants\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"8:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"8:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"8:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"8:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"8:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"8:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"8:0-21:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Rudy's\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-15 09:11:32\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"they always make the food super quick and have the best crunchy chicken tacos that they stuff with lots of chicken and lettuce. I really recommend going if you want good food, it always hits the spot\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-10 22:46:45\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I ordered the Vegan Burrito. As I started eating I thought \\\\\\\"hmm the beyond meat tastes different this time\\\\\\\"Halfway through my burrito I made the realization that this was not in fact vegan and I had been eating carnitas. I immediately vomited across the  dashboard of my car, steering wheel and lap. Got a refund but now my car is a mess and I need to go change my clothes. If you want vegan food just pay the extra couple bucks and go to Mesa Verde or Modern Times.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-11-12 01:28:38\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"My wife loves their Tacos, best she's had in Santa Barbara. We've been enjoying Rudy's since our daughter played soccer at UCSB, almost 10 years ago.\\\\nI love the combination burrito, wet!\\\\nAlways great food & service\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Here is an objective overview of Rudy's based on the provided structured data:\\n\\nRudy's is a Mexican restaurant located in downtown Santa Barbara, California. It has a rating of 4.0 out of 5 stars based on customer reviews. The restaurant offers a variety of dishes, including tacos, burritos, and combos, all made with fresh ingredients. They have a casual and cozy atmosphere, with free WiFi and no reservations available. The restaurant is open seven days a week from 8:00 AM to 10:00 PM, with street parking available.\\n\\nAccording to customer reviews, Rudy's is known for its delicious food, particularly their crunchy chicken tacos and combination burritos. However, there have been some instances of mistakes in orders, such as a non-vegan burrito being served to a vegetarian customer. Additionally, one customer reported that their car was left messy after consuming their meal. Despite these issues, most reviewers praise the restaurant's speedy service, tasty food, and cozy ambiance. Overall, Rudy's appears to be a reliable choice for Mexican cuisine in Santa Barbara, with a focus on quick service and quality ingredients.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "grammar": "root ::= \"{\" ws \"\\\"unsupported_probability\\\"\" ws \":\" ws probability ws \",\" ws \"\\\"source_sentence_id\\\"\" ws \":\" ws citation ws \"}\"\nprobability ::= \"0\" (\".\" [0-9]+)? | \"1\" (\".\" \"0\"+)?\ncitation ::= \"null\" | \"0\" | [1-9] [0-9]*\nws ::= [ \\t\\n\\r]*", "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 69058, "max_tokens": 96, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
