of their food menu to make a complete judgement but the burrito was pretty good.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2019-05-22 16:39:11\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Slow slow slow!!  And they often get my order wrong.  But, they have a monopoly on this side of campus, and have no incentive to perform.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Coral Tree Cafe is a local business located at 5221 Cheadle Hall in Santa Barbara, CA. It is a café that offers a variety of food options including burgers, sandwiches, and other restaurant dishes. The café is open from Monday to Friday, from 7:30 am to 5:00 pm.\\n\\nThe café provides free WiFi and outdoor seating for its customers. They also offer takeout services, making it convenient for those who prefer to enjoy their food elsewhere. However, they do not take reservations and are not particularly suitable for larger groups.\\n\\nBased on the provided review data, Coral Tree Cafe has received mixed feedback from customers. One customer expressed frustration about a perceived microaggression by the staff, which left a negative impression. Another customer mentioned that the café can be slow and occasionally gets orders wrong, but acknowledged that it has a monopoly on that side of the campus. On the other hand, another customer found the café to be underrated and praised the affordability of their coffee compared to Starbucks. They also enjoyed the breakfast burrito.\\n\\nOverall, Coral Tree Cafe has a rating of 3.0 stars. While the café has some areas for improvement, such as customer service and order accuracy, it also offers value for money and enjoyable food options.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
