21-12-11 19:07:43\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Visiting Santa Barbara and found this gem.\\\\nService was excellent, salsas were very Flavorful from the house salsa & guacamole. We order menudo & was not greasy & full of flavor, their hand made tortillas tops this dish, I got the green chilaquilles \\\\nNot to soggy & had just enough kick for me. Definitely will stop by here again when visiting\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-29 01:20:06\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Had a really good meal here tonight. Good service, clean restaurant. Plenty of room to eat inside restaurant.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"\\\"Cesar's Place\\\" is a Mexican restaurant located at 712 N Milpas St, Santa Barbara, CA. It operates from 10:00 am to 9:00 pm every day. The restaurant offers a variety of dishes including Fish & Chips. According to customer reviews, the restaurant is known for its delicious food such as asada quesadilla, enchilada with shrimp in white sauce, menudo, and green chilaquilles. The restaurant has received a commendable average rating of 4.0 stars, with customers praising the flavorsome salsas, the high-quality service, and the clean environment. The restaurant offers take-out services and is suitable for group dining. However, it does not provide WiFi, offer outdoor seating, or accept reservations. Parking is available on-street. The ambiance of the place is described as casual.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "grammar": "root ::= \"{\" ws \"\\\"unsupported_probability\\\"\" ws \":\" ws probability ws \",\" ws \"\\\"source_sentence_id\\\"\" ws \":\" ws citation ws \"}\"\nprobability ::= \"0\" (\".\" [0-9]+)? | \"1\" (\".\" \"0\"+)?\ncitation ::= \"null\" | \"0\" | [1-9] [0-9]*\nws ::= [ \\t\\n\\r]*", "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 69058, "max_tokens":