es, popcorn, dried fruits, legumes, foods made with sorbitol, and oat bran. They should also limit or avoid foods with lactose, including milk, certain cheeses, ice cream, yogurt, and cream cheese. Additionally, high fiber foods like apples, bananas, blueberries, figs, grapefruits, pears, raspberries, avocados, carrots, kale, popcorn, potatoes with the skin, bran, oats, brown rice, whole wheat breads, legumes, peas, and nuts should be avoided.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "grammar": "root ::= \"{\" ws \"\\\"unsupported_probability\\\"\" ws \":\" ws probability ws \",\" ws \"\\\"source_sentence_id\\\"\" ws \":\" ws citation ws \"}\"\nprobability ::= \"0\" (\".\" [0-9]+)? | \"1\" (\".\" \"0\"+)?\ncitation ::= \"null\" | \"0\" | [1-9] [0-9]*\nws ::= [ \\t\\n\\r]*", "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 69058, "max_tokens": 96, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
