lue for money. Overall, Our Lady of Guadalupe Mercado is a gem of a find in Santa Barbara, offering a one-of-a-kind experience that will leave you wanting more.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
